AdaNNpg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/a1ibibUDVg0QqPSNSA33K7ialicVVKypjRNyA070yO31Ia1B9jctEp1TSPqSBGn1xfpa6Uh19Micn0rDCdbTMcJrAmA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>广阔的就业前景</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>H</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>目前毕业校友1000余名，已有6名校友为国家杰出青年科学基金获得者。就业去向主要为国内外高水平大学、科研院所及企业（材料、半导体、电池、电子、通讯、生物医药等领域），包括：华为、大疆、荣耀、中芯国际、龙芯科技、英特尔半导体、京东方、宁德时代、比亚迪、中石油、中石化、三峡集团、航天院、工信部、药明生物、国药集团、拜耳医药、宝洁、杜邦等。</span></p><p><span><span>更多信息了解中心网站：</span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://www.nanoctr.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.nanoctr.cn</a></span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/a1ibibUDVg0QqPSNSA33K7ialicVVKypjRNy9stGocseKNjw4IVo4CFbjod4ic1YXZbKVznB9QvedbZjet12lia43NJw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/a1ibibUDVg0QqPSNSA33K7ialicVVKypjRNylQc2aFgxFtD0iauqZPuUmHFZV9hTSzzPnmkah7IlOfN5eyKUQBFMxaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>  申请指南：如何加入我们  </span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 招生对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Admission Target</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 全国高校化学、物理、材料、生物、医药、电子信息、计算机等相关专业的三年级本科生(拟于2026年毕业)。</span></p><p><span>2. 专业课学习成绩及英语水平优良，预计能获得所在大学推荐免试研究生资格。</span></p><p><span>3. 对学术研究兴趣浓厚，创新意识强、创新能力和专业素养突出；有较强科研工作能力，身心健康、性格开朗。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 活动时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Event Time</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>初步拟定2025年7月上中旬（具体时间及日程安排以网站最新通知为准：</span></p><p><span><a href=\"http://edu.nanoctr.cas.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://edu.nanoctr.cas.cn/</a>）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>  报名方法</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Registration</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 请有意向报名的学生于6月15日前填写问卷链接： </span><span><em><strong><span><a href=\"https://www.wjx.cn/vm/PpQFMro.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/PpQFMro.aspx</span></a></span></strong></em></span><span><em><strong></strong></em></span><span>，填写个人信息并提交；</span></p><p><span>2. 登录中国科学院科教结合协同育人网站：</span><span><em><strong><span><a href=\"http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/</span></a></span></strong></em></span><span> ，选择右侧“大学生夏令营计划报名”栏目，注册后进入申请系统，夏令营承办单位选择</span><span><strong><span>“国家纳米科学中心”</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3. 填报时请仔细阅读报名系统首页的“填报说明”和“常见问题解答”，依次维护全部必填信息，上传照片，审核无误后提交。</span></p><p><span>4. 系统填报申请时，请在“备注”一栏写上：意向导师姓名、推免资格情况（可推免或不可推免或其他需要说明的情况）。如有其他特殊情况，请提前与我们沟通联系后再进行填报提交。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Application materials</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动申请以系统申请为主、纸质材料审查为辅。网上申请填报务必确保信息真实性，如有不实，后果自负。在通过营员遴选后，再提交以下纸质版材料，材料请按以下顺序排列（来中心报到时上交全部材料）。</span></p><p><span>1. 网上申请表；</span></p><p><span>2. 本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>3. 其他证明材料（包括已发表论文或出版物复印件、英语四/六级成绩单、各类奖励证书复印件、其他相关材料等）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 选拔与通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Selection and Notification</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>收到大家的系统报名信息后，我们会尽快组织评委进行选拔，并通过邮件形式通知结果。（备注：本次夏令营活动通过线上与线下相结合的方式进行，具体以后期通知为准）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 招生简章</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Admission Brochure</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>可参考中心2025年推免目录及中心导师介绍</span></p><p><span>1.<a href=\"https://admission.ucas.ac.cn/info/ZhaoshengDanweiDetail/0C5EE6E2-3029-4855-BB6A-8C0E6C43CC74/8017332025\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://admission.ucas.ac.cn/info/ZhaoshengDanweiDetail/0C5EE6E2-3029-4855-BB6A-8C0E6C43CC74/8017332025</a></span></p><p><span>2. <a href=\"http://edu.nanoctr.cas.cn/zs/dsjs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://edu.nanoctr.cas.cn/zs/dsjs/</a> （备注：当年招生导师如有变动，以最新通知为准）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 联系我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Contact us</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>地址：北京市海淀区中关村北一条11号</span><span><br/></span><span>邮编：100190</span><span><br/></span><span>电话：010-82543386</span><span><br/></span><span>邮箱：edu@nanoctr.cn</span><span><br/></span><span>招生咨询QQ群：1039436970</span><span><br/></span><span>微信公众号：NCNST2003</span></p><p><span>特别提示：欢迎关注我们的微信公众号\"NCNST2003\"及官方网站，获取最新招生资讯和科研动态！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>你的科研人生还差这剂猛药</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>准备好你的材料，</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>加入国家纳米中心2025夏令营吧！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/a1ibibUDVg0QqPSNSA33K7ialicVVKypjRNyO8XDsQBUjA6HkZnoIl6e2b4ah7GsXbsvSn5Ajyr1wDlcicTfEiaQlWDQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/a1ibibUDVg0QqPSNSA33K7ialicVVKypjRNyib8Bh6icPOohiaKXVG0ppIkLeqUD8PrUuwWH3Kricg7IVKXaEMzpia9WicLg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心导师介绍            